  "details": "If you weren't one to fortunately upload a future-proofed unitypackage for an avatar or world, you cannot download your asset packages anymore.\nI have used the\nhttps://vrchat.com/api/1/files?n=100&offset=0&apiKey=JlE5Jldo5Jibnk5O5hTx6XVqsJu4WJ26\nURL to retrieve lost avatars more than once (and also helped others with their own recoveries), but the recent changes to attempt to deter theft have made it so you also cannot download your own, and instead presenting you with a \"401 Unauthorized\" message.\n\nYou should be able to access at least your own uploads.",
